{"name":"","question":"","reading":"Your heart is blocked by a past you refuse to release. You have built walls where there should be windows. What once protected you is now keeping you prisoner.","_id":"7m9Q307dVZQuEMGF"}
{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"You have been avoiding a truth you already know. Every distraction you reach for is proof of its weight. The longer you wait, the louder it will become.","_id":"Gu2xAauKcZSd09pN"}
{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"You are carrying a burden that is not yours to bear. It has worn down your spirit and clouded your judgment. Release it before it becomes a permanent part of you.","_id":"HZk8G3xKro6YGvMg"}
